==Trivia==
* Supposedly, the thread was created after [[Elidinis]] saved a dry, barren field of [[flax]] during a drought. She brought water from the [[River Elid]] to the field, restoring the dead and dying plants to life. The first spool of thread created from the rejuvenated flax was dedicated to Elidinis by the farmer's wife, and to her surprise, the thread never ran out, no matter how much was used.

